+## Work completed
+
+- Fixed cancellation to release a single-use coupon with the order ID that recorded its use.
+- Added a red-first regression test covering a customer who cancels and reuses a welcome coupon.
+- Verified that free delivery is already inclusive at €50.00 after discounts; added a characterization
+  test for an order reduced to exactly that amount by a coupon.
+
+## Verification
+
+`npm test` passes: 25 tests, including both reported scenarios.
